BT 1 0 0 1 16 18.8 Tm 14.4 TL /F2 10 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (High availability.) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( Subnets, load balancers and Auto Scaling groups span two Availability Zones, so) Tj T* (losing one zone does not stop the application.) Tj T* ET
