q
BT 1 0 0 1 4 18.8 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (\177) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 16 18.8 Tm 14.4 TL /F2 10 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (Security.) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( Only the external load balancer faces the internet. App servers and the database sit in private) Tj T* (subnets and accept traffic only from the tier in front of them.) Tj T* ET
